128
00:03:45,850 --> 00:03:47,800
Buscas abrir las puertas.

129
00:03:48,230 --> 00:03:49,100
Hay datos.

130
00:03:49,270 --> 00:03:51,170
En dos mil veintidós, investigadores de la

131
00:03:51,190 --> 00:03:54,170
